This directory is the `npm install --omit=dev` output for the s3 quick start's
dependency `@aws-sdk/util-stream-node@3.374.0`, which the AWS Lambda Node.js
runtimes do not bundle. `sam build` installs it into the function artifact; the
quick-start tests add these files under `node_modules/`. The quick start's other
dependency, `@aws-sdk/client-s3`, is bundled by the runtime and is resolved from
StackSim's runtime SDK instead. Only each package's package.json, license, and
CommonJS build are kept.

